From: sean-mcclane832 <swhall2008@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 21:41:11 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Episodic memory: memory_extinction gene extinguishes a
 payment that stopped (issue 210)

A learned zero outcome of an action this place has paid directly is written as a known
outcome when the records still expect at least theta of it. Records built only by replay
or by a demonstration are never extinguished. Founder 0 (off): every brain and checkpoint
is as in 0.89.0.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
